ーカー的存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最初にノートの実験台にされてしまい、それ以降もノートの魔力に翻弄される。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"義影のことをタダの幼なじみだと思っているので、操られている事実に対して理解できずにいる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"147321"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5f/5f05aff55fa9bb4dd85765518d143593cdef40fdbf03ce2e31ba909c08e18d29.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fc/fcbbb781a595aea519c5c739ecdd1c367a14b55333b089b15345159879d19f06.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"なかせひな","creatorId":"vndb:s926","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s926","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s926","name":"なかせ ひな","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:217508:147321:12719:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c32716","characterName":"東三国 幸","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"147326","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"217508"}],"egsCharacterIds":["25646"],"vndbCharacterId":"c32716"},"originalCharacterName":"東三国 幸","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"An underclassman of Yoshikage."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c32716"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"“レストラン・トラサルディ”でバイトをする、主人公の後輩。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生粋のドジっ娘属性を備えており、今まで数々のバイトをクビになっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな彼女をオシオキしながらも雇い続ける主人公に感謝の念を忘れない少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ちなみにバイトの理由は、父の借金返済という、このゲーム最強の苦労人。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25646","sourceWorkId":"7476","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「レストラン・トラサルディ」でバイトをしている女の子で義影の後輩。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"父親が事業に失敗し、借金の返済に協力するためバイトを続けている、このゲーム最強の苦労人。 生来のドジっ娘属性が災いして、今までクビになったバイトの数は両手両足では数えられない。 そんな彼女を「オシオキ」しつつも雇い続けてくれている義影には感謝しているらしい。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"147326"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/77/776751113ad4f5b6d7dca79c3e8c8d5b45885d7bfdb64e38970dfae55ff85351.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d8/d8103bbde819f4b1084bffa952186d0271c834328c597382e18a8e9af93d56c1.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"瑞沢渓","creatorId":"vndb:s28","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s28","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s28","name":"瑞沢 渓","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:217508:147326:5741:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c32717","characterName":"中津 かおる","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"147323","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"217508"}],"egsCharacterIds":["25644"],"vndbCharacterId":"c32717"},"originalCharacterName":"中津 かおる","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A \"veteran\" worker Trussardy, she has been working there for a long time now. She was just married to a very busy businessman."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c32717"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"前オーナーの時代から働く、古株の従業員。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"豊満なボディとおっとりした性格で、そつなく仕事をこなす彼女は、常連客には癒しの対象、後輩達にはいいお手本となっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在、新婚ホヤホヤだが、ダンナが忙しく家を空け気味のため、少々欲求不満なご様子。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25644","sourceWorkId":"7476","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「レストラン・トラサルディ」で働いている従業員の一人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"義影の前オーナー（義影の父親）時代から働いている古株従業員の一人で、現在新婚ホヤホヤ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"豊満な胸と魅力的なプロポーションを誇り、トラサルディの常連には彼女のファンが多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は温厚でおっとりとしているが、芯は強くウェイトレス経験も長いため、仕事はそつなくこなす。縁たち後輩ウェイトレスにとっては良き先輩である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"新婚ながらもダンナ様が忙しくて家を空け気味のため、欲求不満がたまっているとか…。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"147323"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ce/ce33aad41235886d38161974ff0801931aadb9907c42d103a8ff988e2c974b15.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b1/b18ee3a0ec49a33255f705bf0b26679065ff415832d51cf517b7ca11c1c03d21.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"雨宮侑布","creatorId":"vndb:s1450","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1450","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1450","name":"雨宮 侑布","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:217508:147323:4940:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c32718","characterName":"北花田 麗香","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"147325","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"217508"}],"egsCharacterIds":["25645"],"vndbCharacterId":"c32718"},"originalCharacterName":"北花田 麗香","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Yoshikage's classmate who has a bad relationship with him: whenever they come in contact, they always start fighting."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c32718"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ライバル店“レストラン摘み草”のバイト少女で、主人公の同級生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お金持ちの令嬢で成績優秀、だが人当たりがキツいためか友人は少ない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"会うたびに主人公と口喧嘩しているが、自分に普通に接してくれる彼に、密かに感謝している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い体型にコンプレックスを抱いており、彼女の前で話題にすると血の雨が降るとか。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25645","sourceWorkId":"7476","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「レストラン摘み草」でバイトをしている女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"義影の同級生で、義影の悪友と言うべき存在。顔を合わせるたびに口喧嘩ばかりしている。 実家はお金持ちで成績も優秀だが、人当たりがキツい為か友だちは少ない。 そんな自分に普通に接してくれる義影に実は感謝しているが、恥ずかしくて言い出せずにいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"背が低く、幼い体つきにコンプレックスを抱いているので、彼女の前ではその手の話は厳禁。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"147325"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c2/c2d9f6135d4b56b87b2afd0b303809cffd95d9e9cb287b2ded011791240e8b52.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b0/b021cf51f83a0863c747344a5b0d440bbcd5f1f6b252c3186016b721061c88fc.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"梶田夕貴","creatorId":"vndb:s485","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s485","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s485","name":"梶田 夕貴","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:217508:147325:6106:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c32720","characterName":"我孫子 瑠璃","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["25647"],"vndbCharacterId":"c32720"},"originalCharacterName":"我孫子 瑠璃","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A secretary working in the rival restaraunt, \"Restaurant Tsumikisa\". She is interested in younger boys, even though she is quite serious and strict."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c32720"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ライバル店“レストラン摘み草”で秘書をしている才女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しっかり仕事をこなし、秘書としても非常に優秀。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"昔から女の子にモテモテだった彼女、その影響からか、年下の可愛い男の子に目がなく、オーナーの隼人を密かに狙っていたりする。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25647","sourceWorkId":"7476","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"htt